@intent Defeating the Past Shadow of the Queen runs her whole death sequence -- both death lines, The Giver's Pain in the player's inventory -- and leaves her as an NPC who no longer takes damage
@step arena
# a command that changes nothing fails: go through creative so survival is a change
gamemode creative
gamemode survival
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
time set day
weather clear
gamerule doDaylightCycle false
gamerule doMobSpawning false
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 600 4 true
item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with the_last_sword:the_last_sword_you_never_forgot

@step wake her
summon the_last_sword:the_past_shadow_of_the_queen ~ ~ ~3
@expect chat bossshow.the_last_sword.the_past_shadow_of_the_queen.subtitle_2 within 30s

@step defeat her: both death lines, then the reward
execute at @s rotated as @s rotated ~ 0 run tp @e[type=the_last_sword:the_past_shadow_of_the_queen,limit=1,sort=nearest] ^ ^ ^2
@wait 5t
@aim entity the_last_sword:the_past_shadow_of_the_queen
@key key.attack
@expect chat dialogue.the_last_sword.queen.combat.death_1 within 10s
@expect chat dialogue.the_last_sword.queen.combat.death_2 within 10s
@wait 4s
# version-proof slot test (1.21.5 changed the player NBT). The sword itself may be gone after the kill: that is the mod's
# design (seen in play), so nothing here asserts it stays
@assert execute if items entity @s container.* the_last_sword:the_givers_pain
@shot reward

@step she stays, as an NPC who talks
# her death animation runs 160 ticks (the reward lands at tick 100): until it ends she is dying, not an NPC
@wait 6s
# after her death sequence she is revived as an NPC (finishDeathWithoutRemoval(STATE_NPC)); right-clicking an NPC
# opens her dialogue (mobInteract -> NpcDialogueManager.open). @e selectors skip entities that are not isAlive(), so
# aim by type id (the client's view) rather than assert by selector
@aim entity the_last_sword:the_past_shadow_of_the_queen
@key key.use
@expect screen /./ within 5s
@shot npc-dialogue
